      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bb12af0dced58047a4e06a3|full_name}\nIn VRChat with Vive wands gestures will only stay if you have \"Vive Advanced Controls\" which is in the \"settings\" menu, under \"other options\" ticked off.\nIf you have it on, that is the cause of the gestures letting go.  Should be the exact same setting in Avatar 3.  \nI suggest leaving this on until you do long animations and what not, pressing the Vive pad down will cause it to wear out sooner.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
