      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5cc357096bace8277b34e1d9|full_name}: I would also like to bring forward an issue, a regression in lost functionality. After av3 update while using vive advanced controls you can no longer hold gestures and move/turn at same time.\nBefore av3 update players were able to \"while advanced controls\" are active to activate a gesture and temporarily bind it to a trigger button thus allowing movement and turning while said gesture is active.\nAs it stands now, you can still hold gestures via this method but moving or turning prevents all gestures for that hand depending on the controller.",
      "viewerReactions": null
